WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.542
Row C7 says to hand over one spare kit, every time.
原表 C7 要求散场时一律交回一套备用材料。

2
00:00:03.542 --> 00:00:05.375
Unused, both versions reconcile. The receiving table shown is illustrative.
无人领用时，两版均与实点数相符。领用桌号为演示设定。

3
00:00:05.375 --> 00:00:09.917
One spare kit was used in round two. The receiving table shown is illustrative.
原记录写明第二轮动用 1 套备品。画面中的领用桌号为演示设定。

4
00:00:09.917 --> 00:00:14.167
Rename the team lead to fit this workshop.
将首席改名为适合这次活动的现场统筹。

5
00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:22.375
Add a supply receiver to own the handoff count.
新增一名物资接收员，明确由谁核对交接数量。

6
00:00:22.375 --> 00:00:25.167
Export the four-role team as a DeepSeek Harness project.
点击导出，下载四席团队的 DeepSeek Harness 项目。

7
00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:28.417
The downloaded ZIP contains the same four roles.
已下载的 ZIP 中，四个岗位与页面一致。
